WEBVTT

00:01:30.401 --> 00:01:32.583
Imagine for a moment

00:01:32.607 --> 00:01:35.940
that my hands are filled
with a cloud of electrons,

00:01:35.964 --> 00:01:39.140
10 dollars' worth
of coal-fired electricity

00:01:39.164 --> 00:01:42.526
that could power your cell phone
for more than 10 years.

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:44.976
That probably sounds
like a pretty good deal.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.132
But it's only so cheap

00:01:47.156 --> 00:01:50.028
because you're not paying
for the harm that it causes.

00:01:50.623 --> 00:01:55.196
Burning coal sends poisons
like mercury and lead into the air,

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:58.096
increasing healthcare costs
by billions of dollars

00:01:58.120 --> 00:01:59.288
and causing the death

00:01:59.312 --> 00:02:02.187
of hundreds of thousands
of people every year.